# Browse changes: files, folds, split and unified views, all files, go to file.
Source docs/demo/common.tape
Output docs/demo/overview.gif

Type "zdiff" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Down Sleep 1s
Down Sleep 1s
Down Sleep 1s
Down Sleep 1.2s
Screenshot docs/demo/split.png
Tab Sleep 500ms
Type "]" Sleep 800ms
Type "]" Sleep 800ms
Enter Sleep 1.2s
Type "v" Sleep 3s
Screenshot docs/demo/unified.png
Type "v" Sleep 1s
Type "a" Sleep 1s
Type@120ms "jjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjj" Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+P Sleep 600ms
Type@150ms "cach" Sleep 800ms
Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
